      "openalex_id": "W2509823961",
      "doi": "10.12946/rg24/020-072",
      "title": "The Germanists and the Historical School of Law: German Legal Science between Romanticism, Realism, and Rationalization",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Gerhard Dilcher",
          "openalex_id": "A5044871047"
