    {
      "openalex_id": "W4386289186",
      "doi": "10.46222/pharosjot.104.427",
      "title": "Aisthetics of Religion and embodied spiritual perception: hermeneutic approaches in Hesychasm, Christian Platonism, and Aesthetics of Idealism, to \u2018divine light\u2019 and \u2018mystical flight\u2019",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "Ullrich Relebogilwe Kleinhempel",
          "openalex_id": "A5067998217",
